loom cold_pass=standing_equipment guards=114 green=108 red=3 gated=4 wall_s=814
file tools/fixtures/f/fleet_roster_control.sh the leg that named a machine is cut; its one reading now stands beside wrong_tree_refused, derived from the roster
file tools/fixtures/i/index_row_bound_scan.sh rows_misordered gates document order on the pages already read, and the header says what it gates
file tools/fixtures/i/index_row_bound_control.sh nine legs for the fourth reading, and three ascending fixtures flipped to model a newest-first page
file tools/in/index_row_bound_witness.rish the field assert and nine control asserts, and the count moves 31 -> 40 in prose that is measured rather than recited
file construction/REDS.md %446 booked and closed, %440 closed on its loom, headline re-measured 445 -> 446
file construction/archive/REDS-the-reading-one-short-rows-440-446.md both rows folded together because they are one lesson in two materials
file construction/ITINERARY.md this lap's account, two stale claims corrected, and one duplicated passage condensed to pay for it
recommend kg -- agent_jail went to a peer as %446 while I worked, so the mktemp probe is the door: 353 sites, no probe, not POSIX since 2008, and require_instrument is already seated to carry it.
